# Gmail SMTP Transfer Configuration
# To send real Ticketmaster transfer emails via Gmail:
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your Gmail and App Password below:
GMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password

# Public Base URL for transfer links (e.g., http://localhost:3000 or your custom domain)
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
